This repo is `smash-gamepad-overlay`, a Rust/cargo-skyline Super Smash Bros. Ultimate in-game controller overlay.

Before making architectural changes, read:
- AGENTS.md
- AGENTSUMMARY.md
- README.md
- docs/alpha-validation-checklist.md
- docs/skin-converter-notes.md when working on skins

AGENTSUMMARY.md is the canonical current-state handoff summary.

Key constraints:
- Runtime feature must remain an in-game Skyline plugin.
- Do not implement a PC/OBS/browser/network overlay.
- Online research and external repo inspection are allowed.
- Do not commit Nintendo assets such as data.arc, layout.arc, extracted BFLYT/BFLAN/BNTX files, textures, or modified game assets.
- Keep DebugText fallback unless explicitly removing it.
- Preserve Training Modpack compatibility and patched info_melee/layout.arc workflow.
